WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.360
Identify and practise moral lessons from the lives of religious leaders.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.381
The curriculum highlights honesty, patience, hard work, courage, sacrifice and

00:00:09.381 --> 00:00:13.981
perseverance as lessons associated with religious leaders. People can practise these

00:00:13.981 --> 00:00:17.744
qualities at home, in class and in the community.

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:23.497
A responsible leader listens and serves others. Faith traditions may teach these

00:00:23.497 --> 00:00:25.123
virtues through different stories.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:30.238
Choose a virtue and act out a 30-second situation that demonstrates it.
